   "line": [
    "c4"
   ],
   "spoken": "White clamps with the pawn to c4, trying to hang on to the extra central pawn and cramp Black. It is an underrated try that needs a precise response.",
   "kind": "main",
   "teaches": "A c4 clamp holding an extra pawn must be met actively, not passively.",
   "plans": "Strike back to unlock full compensation."
  },
  {
   "ply": 8,
   "t": 2037,
   "fen": "rnbqkb1r/pp3ppp/4pn2/2pP4/2P5/8/PP1P1PPP/RNBQKBNR w KQkq - 0 5",
   "line": [
    "e6"
   ],
   "spoken": "The key is the pawn to e6, undermining the d5-wedge to unlock the compensation. White has to take, and Black recaptures with the bishop, emerging with fast, active development for the pawn.",
   "kind": "main",
   "teaches": "Sacrifice a tempo/pawn with e6 to open lines and activate the pieces — development is the compensation.",
   "plans": "Recapture with the bishop and develop with pressure."
  },
  {
   "ply": 10,
   "t": 2043,
   "fen": "rn1qkb1r/pp3ppp/4bn2/2p5/2P5/8/PP1P1PPP/RNBQKBNR w KQkq - 0 6",
   "line": [
    "dxe6",
    "Bxe6"
   ],
   "spoken": ""
  },
  {
   "ply": 11,
   "t": 2054.5,
   "fen": "rn1qkb1r/pp3ppp/4bn2/2p5/2P5/5N2/PP1P1PPP/RNBQKB1R b KQkq - 1 6",
   "line": [
    "Nf3"
